# Fold-in or discard — {{CLIENT_NAME}}

**Every hack goes into production and stays there.** If it makes someone's life easier it will run for years, and you will own it.

At ship time, **every artefact gets an explicit call**: fold it into the core offering, or discard it by a **named date**. "Temporary" is not a state — it is a story we tell ourselves on the way to supporting something for a decade.

A G2 behaviour and a G3 criterion. **Nothing may be labelled "temporary".**

<!-- table:fold-in-or-discard.rows role=register id=Artefact -->

| Artefact | What it is | Call | Discard by (date) | Owner | Folded into | Decided by |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|

`Call` is exactly one of `fold-in` or `discard`. There is no third value.

